                        


Item #:  SCP-5138

Object Class:  Euclid

Special Containment Procedures: 

Must be kept in a 2x2x2 foot steel box.

If SCP-5138 breaches, all personel on site must put on a gas mask.

No more than 2 personel may enter at any given time.

The box must be decontaminated and cleaned once a day.

Upon removal of SCP-5138-1 they must be put inside a steel box under the temperature of 0° Celcius for 24 hours.

Instances of SCP-5138-1 must be seperated from SCP-5083 to prevent replication of SCP-5138.

If SCP-5138-1 hatches, it is to be neutralized.

Description: 

SCP-5138 appears to be a chicken that leaves behind radioactive waste that is similar to hydrochloric acid.

This radioactive waste is known as SCP-5138-2.

SCP-5138-1 instances are eggs laid by SCP-5138.

They will taste like anything the consumer is craving.

Any living thing breathing SCP-5138-2 will instantly have a heart attack.

                    

                                    





            
    

                    



                    
                        
                            
